+        //                         SIGABRTs in a loop. Proven by single-variable boot test: the safe
+        //                         set boots, the safe set PLUS this one name does not.
+        //   VK_GOOGLE_user_type   has no entry in mesa's ALLOWED_ANDROID_VERSION, and VK_GOOGLE is
