+        // the replacement drops the `#ifdef ANDROID_STRICT / vk_android_allowed_device_extensions`
+        // filter that upstream applies in vk_physical_device.c. Enumeration and validation are
+        // therefore ASYMMETRIC: anything supported-but-not-Android-allowed is advertised to the app
+        // and then rejected at vkCreateDevice. Before adding a name, check it in the GENERATED
+        // build/src/vulkan/util/vk_extensions.c, not in the registry.
